  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\nGodan verb ending in す ({志|こころざ}す → {志|こころざ}して → {志|こころざ}した). Takes を to mark the goal or profession: Xを{志|こころざ}す.\n\nThe related noun {志|こころざし} (ambition, aspiration, will) is also commonly used.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {医者|いしゃ}を{志|こころざ}す: to aspire to become a doctor\n- {道|みち}を{志|こころざ}す: to aspire to a path/career\n- {政治家|せいじか}を{志|こころざ}す: to aspire to become a politician\n- {高|たか}い{理想|りそう}を{志|こころざ}す: to aspire to high ideals",
